  "title": "Homemade Cinnamon Rolls",
  "description": "These fluffy, moist cinnamon rolls made from scratch, complete with a sticky cinnamon filling and gooey frosting, are the best homemade cinnamon rolls ever!",
  "authors": [
    "newyorkbaker3"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:40:49-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2025-10-28T08:52:13-04:00",
